{
  "_comment": [
    "The swamp at the foot of a hollow tree, where the sea comes in: mangroves through shallow water, clay pools with dripleaves in the mud, blue orchids, ferns and sugar cane, lily pads, and glow berries and roots hanging from the first shelf.",
    "Laid only inside a hollow tree, by the landform rather than by any climate (`HollowTreesField.biomes`), and given no word, so nothing else can grow it. Its creatures and monsters are the jungle's; its sky is the Age's own."
